The checkout shows a total of `19.982` for one item at 9.99 bought twice, plus 2 for shipping. It should show `21.98`. Which line causes this?

```javascript
function orderTotal(items, shipping) {
  const subtotal = items.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.price * item.qty, 0);
  const rounded = subtotal.toFixed(2);
  return rounded + shipping;
}

orderTotal([{ price: 9.99, qty: 2 }], 2);
```
